RENDER INFRA
On Render, all free services spin down after 15 minutes of inactivity. The only exception is static sites, which stay up permanently.

When a service spins down:
The service goes to sleep
The next request takes longer (spin-up time)
Users may experience delays on first interaction

Subscription
Render has two separate subscription layers:
Workspace Subscription
Applies at the workspace level (topmost level)
Controls features available to all services in that workspace
Two main plans: Hobby (Free) and Professional (Paid)
Service Subscription
Applies to individual services
Controls resources for that specific service
Multiple tiers: Free, Starter, Standard, Pro, etc.

Both subscriptions cost money independently. You pay for the workspace AND you pay for each service.
