Internal Service Communication
On Render, the backend services communicate using internal service names (not custom domains:
STAG: be-app calls botai at http://botai-stag:5000
PROD: be-app calls botai at http://botai-prod:5000
Benefits:
Traffic stays within Render's network (faster, more secure)
No custom domain needed for service-to-service communication since we had a limitation on that
This matches our AWS setup approach

